{% extends "layout/gates.twig" %}
{% block content %}

<section class="r26-hero" style="padding-block:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.25rem) clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.5rem);text-align:center">
  <img class="r26-hero__wm" src="/assets/img/africa-watermark.svg?v={{ asset_version }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="r26-hero__inner">
      <p class="r26-eyebrow r26-reveal r26-d1" style="justify-content:center;display:inline-flex">Last updated · 1 May 2025</p>
      <h1 class="r26-hl r26-reveal r26-d2" style="font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.2vw,3.9rem)">Terms of <em style="color:var(--emerald-600)">use.</em></h1>
      <p class="r26-sub r26-reveal r26-d3" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Plain rules for participating in nominations, votes, and the registry. Read before you submit.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<article class="r26-article wrap" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="r26-prose" data-anim>
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">Participation</h2>
    <p>You can nominate, vote, register a profile, comment, and apply for opportunities, free of charge, provided you are 16 or older and located in or attributable to one of the 54 African nations covered by GATES.</p>

    <h2>One verified voice</h2>
    <p>Each verified email address may cast one vote per category, per cycle. Submitting multiple emails, automated submissions, or coordinated brigading invalidates the affected votes and may suspend the profile.</p>

    <h2>Moderation</h2>
    <p>Nominations, comments, and threads are moderated for accuracy and respect. We remove submissions that defame, target individuals abusively, or contain unverified claims presented as fact.</p>

    <h2>Content ownership</h2>
    <p>You retain copyright on anything you submit. By submitting, you grant Africa GATES a non-exclusive licence to display, archive, and surface that content on the platform and in cycle communications.</p>

    <h2>The legacy vault</h2>
    <p>Once a cycle closes, the resulting winners, jury rationales, and final rankings become permanent records in the legacy vault. We do not retroactively edit historical attribution.</p>

    <h2>Disputes</h2>
    <p>Questions, takedowns, or jury appeals can be sent to <a href="mailto:appeals@afrovanguard.org.ng">appeals@afrovanguard.org.ng</a>. We respond within 14 days.</p>

    <p style="margin-top:2rem;font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--neutral-500,#6b7478)">Africa GATES is an initiative of <a href="https://afrovanguard.org.ng">Afrovanguard</a>.</p>
  </div>
</article>

{% endblock %}
